-- 0016 additional official breeder benchmark profiles
--
-- Adds Arbor Acres Plus, Indian River, Hubbard Conventional (EDGE), and
-- Cobb500 Fast Feather alongside 0011's Ross 308, plus the four metric
-- definitions only the Cobb supplements publish (fertility weekly/cumulative,
-- cumulative flock mortality, chick weight).
--
-- Cobb500 Slow Feather was imported alongside Fast Feather on 2026-08-28 and
-- retired on 2026-08-29: the flock this app is used against runs the Fast
-- Feather line, and a second Cobb profile only invites comparing a flock
-- against the wrong one. This file has never been applied, so the retirement
-- is a regeneration rather than a cloud delete. Local installs that already
-- imported it are cleaned up by the SQLite v81 migration.
--
-- GENERATED — do not hand-edit. Regenerate with:
--   dart run tool/gen_breeder_benchmark_seed_sql.dart \
--     assets/benchmarks/aviagen_arboracres_plus_parent_stock_2021_en.json \
--     assets/benchmarks/aviagen_indianriver_parent_stock_2021_en.json \
--     assets/benchmarks/hubbard_conventional_edge_parent_stock_2025_en.json \
--     assets/benchmarks/cobb500_fast_feather_parent_stock_2020_en.json
--
-- Same asset files the local importer reads
-- (lib/data/database/seeds/breeder_benchmark_seeds.dart), so cloud and local
-- hold identical values. Apply after 0011 — it creates these tables, their
-- RLS policies, and the immutability triggers this file's draft -> active
-- sequence is written to satisfy.

